<details><summary>Reveal the exact closed-form proof</summary>
Telescoping gives $D_n=1+\sum_{j=0}^{n-1}j=1+n(n-1)/2$. Dividing by $n^2$ yields $1/2-1/(2n)+1/n^2$, which tends to $1/2$.
</details>

